Bulwark Lite is the static edition of Bulwark Webmail, a webmail client
for mail, calendar, contacts and files built on JMAP. It is developed for
the Stalwart Mail Server but works with other JMAP servers.

It runs entirely in the browser and is served by any web server, without
Node.js. Features that need the server of the full edition (admin console,
plugins, settings sync, web push) are not available; the full edition is
mail/bulwark.

The package also contains the upstream application bundle for Stalwart,
merged with local changes (configuration, logos) into a bundle that
Stalwart loads from the local file system.
